>> name: 味噌汁
>> description: A simple everyday miso soup with tofu and wakame. Comforting and quick.
>> servings: 2
>> tags: japanese, soup, quick

Bring @dashi{500%ml} to a gentle simmer in a #pot{} over medium heat.
Add @tofu{150%g} (cut in 1 cm cubes) and @wakame{5%g} (dried, rehydrated).
Simmer for ~{2%min} until tofu is warmed through.
Remove from heat, then dissolve @miso{2%tbsp} into the soup using a ladle or strainer.
Do not boil after adding miso.
Garnish with @green onion{} (thinly sliced) and serve immediately.
